<html><head><meta content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" http-equiv="content-type"><style type="text/css">ol{margin:0;padding:0}table td,table th{padding:0}.c4{color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:"Arial";font-style:normal}.c0{color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:"Arial";font-style:normal}.c1{padding-top:0pt;padding-bottom:0pt;line-height:1.15;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left}.c5{background-color:#ffffff;max-width:451.4pt;padding:72pt 72pt 72pt 72pt}.c3{height:11pt}.c2{background-color:#00ff00}.title{padding-top:0pt;color:#000000;font-size:26pt;padding-bottom:3pt;font-family:"Arial";line-height:1.15;page-break-after:avoid;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left}.subtitle{padding-top:0pt;color:#666666;font-size:15pt;padding-bottom:16pt;font-family:"Arial";line-height:1.15;page-break-after:avoid;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left}li{color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:"Arial"}p{margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:"Arial"}h1{padding-top:20pt;color:#000000;font-size:20pt;padding-bottom:6pt;font-family:"Arial";line-height:1.15;page-break-after:avoid;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left}h2{padding-top:18pt;color:#000000;font-size:16pt;padding-bottom:6pt;font-family:"Arial";line-height:1.15;page-break-after:avoid;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left}h3{padding-top:16pt;color:#434343;font-size:14pt;padding-bottom:4pt;font-family:"Arial";line-height:1.15;page-break-after:avoid;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left}h4{padding-top:14pt;color:#666666;font-size:12pt;padding-bottom:4pt;font-family:"Arial";line-height:1.15;page-break-after:avoid;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left}h5{padding-top:12pt;color:#666666;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:4pt;font-family:"Arial";line-height:1.15;page-break-after:avoid;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left}h6{padding-top:12pt;color:#666666;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:4pt;font-family:"Arial";line-height:1.15;page-break-after:avoid;font-style:italic;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left}</style></head><body class="c5 doc-content"><p class="c1"><span class="c4">Tu&#7847;n 1:</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Question 1</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">1 / 1 pts</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">D&#7883;ch v&#7909; th&#432;&#7901;ng &#273;&#432;&#7907;c &#273;&#7883;nh ngh&#297;a l&agrave; g&igrave;?</span></p><p class="c1 c3"><span class="c0"></span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0 c2">&nbsp; M&#7897;t h&agrave;nh &#273;&#7897;ng mang l&#7841;i l&#7907;i &iacute;ch (act of beneficial activity) </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; M&#7897;t s&#7843;n ph&#7849;m v&#7853;t l&yacute; c&oacute; th&#7875; l&#432;u tr&#7919; </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; M&#7897;t quy tr&igrave;nh s&#7843;n xu&#7845;t h&agrave;ng lo&#7841;t </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; M&#7897;t h&igrave;nh th&#7913;c &#273;&#7847;u t&#432; t&agrave;i ch&iacute;nh </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Correct answer</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Question 2</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">1 / 1 pts</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Ba nh&oacute;m ngu&#7891;n l&#7921;c truy&#7873;n th&#7889;ng &#273;&#432;&#7907;c huy &#273;&#7897;ng trong qu&aacute; tr&igrave;nh bi&#7871;n &#273;&#7893;i (transformation) &#273;&#7875; t&#7841;o ra d&#7883;ch v&#7909; l&agrave; g&igrave;?</span></p><p class="c1 c3"><span class="c0"></span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0 c2">&nbsp; T&#7921; nhi&ecirc;n, Con ng&#432;&#7901;i, Nh&acirc;n t&#7841;o/H&#7841; t&#7847;ng </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; V&#7889;n, Lao &#273;&#7897;ng, C&ocirc;ng ngh&#7879; th&ocirc;ng tin </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; &#272;&#7845;t &#273;ai, Ti&#7873;n t&#7879;, Th&#432;&#417;ng hi&#7879;u </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; Kh&aacute;ch h&agrave;ng, &#272;&#7889;i th&#7911; c&#7841;nh tranh, Nh&agrave; cung c&#7845;p </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Correct answer</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Question 3</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">1 / 1 pts</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&quot;&#272;i&#7875;m ch&#7841;m d&#7883;ch v&#7909;&quot; (Service Encounter) c&ograve;n &#273;&#432;&#7907;c g&#7885;i l&agrave; g&igrave; trong b&agrave;i gi&#7843;ng?</span></p><p class="c1 c3"><span class="c0"></span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0 c2">&nbsp; &quot;Moment of Truth&quot; (kho&#7843;nh kh&#7855;c quy&#7871;t &#273;&#7883;nh) </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; &quot;Point of Sale&quot; (&#273;i&#7875;m b&aacute;n h&agrave;ng) </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; &quot;Value Chain&quot; (chu&#7895;i gi&aacute; tr&#7883;) </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; &quot;Service Recovery&quot; (ph&#7909;c h&#7891;i d&#7883;ch v&#7909;) </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Correct answer</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Question 4</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">1 / 1 pts</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Trong v&iacute; d&#7909; d&#7883;ch v&#7909; &#259;n u&#7889;ng, ai l&agrave; &quot;nh&agrave; cung c&#7845;p&quot; (provider)?</span></p><p class="c1 c3"><span class="c0"></span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0 c2">&nbsp; Nh&agrave; h&agrave;ng </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; Kh&aacute;ch h&agrave;ng </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; M&oacute;n &#259;n </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; Ho&aacute; &#273;&#417;n </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Correct answer</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Question 5</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">1 / 1 pts</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Y&#7871;u t&#7889; n&agrave;o sau &#273;&acirc;y KH&Ocirc;NG th&#7875; thi&#7871;u khi th&#7921;c hi&#7879;n b&#7845;t k&#7923; d&#7883;ch v&#7909; n&agrave;o, v&igrave; m&#7885;i t&#432;&#417;ng t&aacute;c gi&#7919;a nh&agrave; cung c&#7845;p v&agrave; kh&aacute;ch h&agrave;ng &#273;&#7873;u c&#7847;n n&oacute;?</span></p><p class="c1 c3"><span class="c0"></span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0 c2">&nbsp; Th&#7901;i gian </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; M&agrave;u s&#7855;c </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; K&iacute;ch th&#432;&#7899;c </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; Tr&#7885;ng l&#432;&#7907;ng </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Correct answer</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Question 6</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">1 / 1 pts</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp;Trong 4 giai &#273;o&#7841;n c&#7911;a v&ograve;ng &#273;&#7901;i d&#7883;ch v&#7909;, giai &#273;o&#7841;n n&agrave;o l&agrave; n&#417;i ph&#7847;n l&#7899;n &#273;i&#7875;m ch&#7841;m d&#7883;ch v&#7909; di&#7877;n ra?</span></p><p class="c1 c3"><span class="c0"></span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0 c2">&nbsp; Th&#7921;c hi&#7879;n (Perform) </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; Ph&aacute;t tri&#7875;n (Develop) </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; T&igrave;m hi&#7875;u (Learn) </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; C&#7843;i ti&#7871;n (Improve) </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Correct answer</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Question 7</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">1 / 1 pts</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp;N&#7871;u m&#7897;t kh&aacute;ch h&agrave;ng kh&ocirc;ng h&agrave;i l&ograve;ng &#7903; m&#7897;t &#273;i&#7875;m ch&#7841;m nh&#432;ng sau &#273;&oacute; &#273;&#432;&#7907;c l&agrave;m h&agrave;i l&ograve;ng tr&#7903; l&#7841;i &#7903; &#273;i&#7875;m ch&#7841;m ti&#7871;p theo, kh&aacute;i ni&#7879;m n&agrave;o m&ocirc; t&#7843; &#273;i&#7873;u n&agrave;y?</span></p><p class="c1 c3"><span class="c0"></span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0 c2">&nbsp; Ph&#7909;c h&#7891;i d&#7883;ch v&#7909; </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; To&agrave;n c&#7847;u h&oacute;a </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; Chu&#7895;i gi&aacute; tr&#7883; </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; Marketing Mix </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Quiz Score: 7 out of 7</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c4">Tu&#7847;n 2:</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Correct answer</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Question 1</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">1 / 1 pts</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Ph&aacute;t bi&#7875;u n&agrave;o m&ocirc; t&#7843; &#273;&uacute;ng nh&#7845;t b&#7843;n ch&#7845;t c&#7911;a SOA?</span></p><p class="c1 c3"><span class="c0"></span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0 c2">&nbsp; M&#7897;t tri&#7871;t l&yacute; thi&#7871;t k&#7871;, chia ch&#7913;c n&#259;ng th&agrave;nh c&aacute;c d&#7883;ch v&#7909; &#273;&#7897;c l&#7853;p giao ti&#7871;p qua giao di&#7879;n r&otilde; r&agrave;ng </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; M&#7897;t giao th&#7913;c truy&#7873;n th&ocirc;ng d&#7921;a tr&ecirc;n XML </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; M&#7897;t n&#7873;n t&#7843;ng &#273;&oacute;ng g&oacute;i &#7913;ng d&#7909;ng b&#7857;ng container </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; M&#7897;t lo&#7841;i c&#417; s&#7903; d&#7919; li&#7879;u ph&acirc;n t&aacute;n </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Correct answer</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Question 2</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">1 / 1 pts</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp;D&#7883;ch v&#7909; Thanh to&aacute;n &#273;&#7893;i t&#7915; Momo sang VNPay &#7903; b&ecirc;n trong, c&ograve;n d&#7883;ch v&#7909; Gi&#7887; h&agrave;ng v&#7851;n g&#7885;i c&ugrave;ng m&#7897;t API nh&#432; c&#361; m&agrave; kh&ocirc;ng c&#7847;n s&#7917;a g&igrave;. &#272;&acirc;y l&agrave; minh h&#7885;a cho nguy&ecirc;n l&yacute; n&agrave;o?</span></p><p class="c1 c3"><span class="c0"></span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0 c2">&nbsp; Loose Coupling (K&#7871;t n&#7889;i l&#7887;ng l&#7867;o) </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; Reusability (T&aacute;i s&#7917; d&#7909;ng) </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; Statelessness (Kh&ocirc;ng tr&#7841;ng th&aacute;i) </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; Monolith </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Correct answer</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Question 3</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">1 / 1 pts</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp;M&#7897;t ng&acirc;n h&agrave;ng d&ugrave;ng chung m&#7897;t d&#7883;ch v&#7909; X&aacute;c th&#7921;c ng&#432;&#7901;i d&ugrave;ng cho app di &#273;&#7897;ng, website v&agrave; h&#7879; th&#7889;ng n&#7897;i b&#7897; nh&acirc;n vi&ecirc;n. L&#7907;i &iacute;ch ch&iacute;nh c&#7911;a nguy&ecirc;n l&yacute; &#273;&#432;&#7907;c &aacute;p d&#7909;ng &#7903; &#273;&acirc;y l&agrave; g&igrave;?</span></p><p class="c1 c3"><span class="c0"></span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0 c2">&nbsp; Gi&#7843;m chi ph&iacute; ph&aacute;t tri&#7875;n v&agrave; &#273;&#7843;m b&#7843;o quy t&#7855;c b&#7843;o m&#7853;t nh&#7845;t qu&aacute;n gi&#7919;a c&aacute;c &#7913;ng d&#7909;ng </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; T&#259;ng t&#7889;c &#273;&#7897; truy&#7873;n d&#7919; li&#7879;u qua m&#7841;ng </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; Cho ph&eacute;p m&#7895;i &#7913;ng d&#7909;ng c&oacute; c&#417; s&#7903; d&#7919; li&#7879;u ri&ecirc;ng </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; Lo&#7841;i b&#7887; nhu c&#7847;u d&ugrave;ng m&atilde; x&aacute;c th&#7921;c (token) </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Correct answer</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Question 4</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">1 / 1 pts</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Khi g&#7885;i API &#39;T&iacute;nh ph&iacute; v&#7853;n chuy&#7875;n&#39;, b&#7841;n kh&ocirc;ng c&#7847;n bi&#7871;t d&#7883;ch v&#7909; d&ugrave;ng thu&#7853;t to&aacute;n &#273;&#7883;nh tuy&#7871;n n&agrave;o hay ch&#7841;y tr&ecirc;n m&aacute;y ch&#7911; &#7903; &#273;&acirc;u. &#272;i&#7873;u n&agrave;y th&#7875; hi&#7879;n nguy&ecirc;n l&yacute; n&agrave;o?</span></p><p class="c1 c3"><span class="c0"></span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0 c2">&nbsp; Abstraction (Tr&#7915;u t&#432;&#7907;ng h&oacute;a) </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; Reusability </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; Statelessness </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; Service Discovery </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Correct answer</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Question 5</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">1 / 1 pts</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">V&igrave; sao nguy&ecirc;n l&yacute; Kh&ocirc;ng tr&#7841;ng th&aacute;i (Statelessness) gi&uacute;p h&#7879; th&#7889;ng d&#7877; m&#7903; r&#7897;ng?</span></p><p class="c1 c3"><span class="c0"></span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0 c2">&nbsp; V&igrave; m&#7895;i y&ecirc;u c&#7847;u ch&#7913;a &#273;&#7911; th&ocirc;ng tin c&#7847;n thi&#7871;t, n&ecirc;n b&#7845;t k&#7923; m&aacute;y ch&#7911; n&agrave;o c&#361;ng x&#7917; l&yacute; &#273;&#432;&#7907;c m&agrave; kh&ocirc;ng c&#7847;n &#273;&#7891;ng b&#7897; tr&#7841;ng th&aacute;i </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; V&igrave; d&#7883;ch v&#7909; l&#432;u to&agrave;n b&#7897; phi&ecirc;n &#273;&#259;ng nh&#7853;p c&#7911;a ng&#432;&#7901;i d&ugrave;ng trong b&#7897; nh&#7899; </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; V&igrave; c&aacute;c d&#7883;ch v&#7909; d&ugrave;ng chung m&#7897;t c&#417; s&#7903; d&#7919; li&#7879;u </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; V&igrave; ch&#7881; c&oacute; m&#7897;t m&aacute;y ch&#7911; duy nh&#7845;t x&#7917; l&yacute; m&#7885;i y&ecirc;u c&#7847;u </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Correct answer</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Question 6</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">1 / 1 pts</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Trong b&#7897; ba Web Services truy&#7873;n th&#7889;ng, WSDL c&oacute; vai tr&ograve; g&igrave;?</span></p><p class="c1 c3"><span class="c0"></span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0 c2">&nbsp; T&agrave;i li&#7879;u XML m&ocirc; t&#7843; &#39;h&#7907;p &#273;&#7891;ng&#39; c&#7911;a d&#7883;ch v&#7909;: c&oacute; nh&#7919;ng h&agrave;m n&agrave;o, nh&#7853;n/tr&#7843; v&#7873; d&#7919; li&#7879;u g&igrave; </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; Giao th&#7913;c nh&#7855;n tin d&#7921;a tr&ecirc;n XML </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; &#39;Danh b&#7841;&#39; &#273;&#7875; &#273;&#259;ng k&yacute; v&agrave; t&igrave;m ki&#7871;m d&#7883;ch v&#7909; </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; L&#7899;p h&#7841; t&#7847;ng qu&#7843;n l&yacute; giao ti&#7871;p gi&#7919;a c&aacute;c d&#7883;ch v&#7909; </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Correct answer</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Question 7</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">1 / 1 pts</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&#272;&#7863;c &#273;i&#7875;m n&agrave;o sau &#273;&acirc;y thu&#7897;c v&#7873; REST ch&#7913; KH&Ocirc;NG ph&#7843;i SOAP?</span></p><p class="c1 c3"><span class="c0"></span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0 c2">&nbsp; D&ugrave;ng c&aacute;c ph&#432;&#417;ng th&#7913;c HTTP c&oacute; s&#7861;n (GET/POST/PUT/DELETE) v&agrave; th&#432;&#7901;ng trao &#273;&#7893;i JSON </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; B&#7855;t bu&#7897;c d&ugrave;ng &#273;&#7883;nh d&#7841;ng XML </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; C&oacute; nhi&#7873;u chu&#7849;n ph&#7909; WS-* nh&#432; WS-Security </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; Th&#432;&#7901;ng d&ugrave;ng trong h&#7879; th&#7889;ng ng&acirc;n h&agrave;ng l&otilde;i &#273;&#7875; &#273;&#7843;m b&#7843;o chu&#7849;n h&oacute;a nghi&ecirc;m ng&#7863;t </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Correct answer</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Question 8</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">1 / 1 pts</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&#272;i&#7875;m kh&aacute;c bi&#7879;t n&agrave;o gi&#7919;a Microservices v&agrave; SOA truy&#7873;n th&#7889;ng l&agrave; &#272;&Uacute;NG?</span></p><p class="c1 c3"><span class="c0 c2"></span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0 c2">&nbsp; M&#7895;i microservice th&#432;&#7901;ng c&oacute; c&#417; s&#7903; d&#7919; li&#7879;u ri&ecirc;ng v&agrave; &#273;&#432;&#7907;c tri&#7875;n khai &#273;&#7897;c l&#7853;p (vd: b&#7857;ng Docker) </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; Microservices chia s&#7867; m&#7897;t c&#417; s&#7903; d&#7919; li&#7879;u chung, SOA truy&#7873;n th&#7889;ng th&igrave; m&#7895;i d&#7883;ch v&#7909; c&oacute; CSDL ri&ecirc;ng </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; Microservices b&#7855;t bu&#7897;c d&ugrave;ng ESB l&agrave;m h&#7841; t&#7847;ng chung </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; SOA truy&#7873;n th&#7889;ng c&oacute; d&#7883;ch v&#7909; nh&#7887; h&#417;n microservices </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Correct answer</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Question 9</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">1 / 1 pts</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Trong h&#7879; th&#7889;ng microservices, API Gateway &#273;&oacute;ng vai tr&ograve; g&igrave;?</span></p><p class="c1 c3"><span class="c0"></span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0 c2">&nbsp; C&#7893;ng v&agrave;o duy nh&#7845;t ti&#7871;p nh&#7853;n y&ecirc;u c&#7847;u t&#7915; client r&#7891;i &#273;&#7883;nh tuy&#7871;n &#273;&#7871;n &#273;&uacute;ng d&#7883;ch v&#7909; n&#7897;i b&#7897; </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; L&#432;u tr&#7919; d&#7919; li&#7879;u d&ugrave;ng chung cho m&#7885;i d&#7883;ch v&#7909; </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; &#272;&oacute;ng g&oacute;i d&#7883;ch v&#7909; th&agrave;nh container </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; M&ocirc; t&#7843; h&#7907;p &#273;&#7891;ng d&#7883;ch v&#7909; b&#7857;ng XML </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Correct answer</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Question 10</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">1 / 1 pts</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">M&#7897;t h&#7879; th&#7889;ng c&oacute; h&agrave;ng ch&#7909;c d&#7883;ch v&#7909;, c&aacute;c instance li&ecirc;n t&#7909;c &#273;&#432;&#7907;c t&#7841;o m&#7899;i v&agrave; t&#7855;t &#273;i. Th&agrave;nh ph&#7847;n n&agrave;o gi&uacute;p c&aacute;c d&#7883;ch v&#7909; t&#7921; &#273;&#7897;ng bi&#7871;t d&#7883;ch v&#7909; kh&aacute;c &#273;ang ch&#7841;y &#7903; &#273;&acirc;u?</span></p><p class="c1 c3"><span class="c0"></span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0 c2">&nbsp; Service Registry &amp; Discovery </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; API Gateway </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; WSDL </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; Monolith </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Quiz Score: 10 out of 10</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c4">Tu&#7847;n 3</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Question 1</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">1 / 1 pts</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Theo t&agrave;i li&#7879;u b&agrave;i gi&#7843;ng, 5 y&#7871;u t&#7889; then ch&#7889;t &#273;&#7875; x&acirc;y d&#7921;ng m&#7885;i m&ocirc; h&igrave;nh t&#7889;i &#432;u h&oacute;a</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">l&#7847;n l&#432;&#7907;t l&agrave; g&igrave;?</span></p><p class="c1 c3"><span class="c0"></span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0 c2">&nbsp; D&#7919; li&#7879;u &#273;&#7847;u v&agrave;o, Bi&#7871;n quy&#7871;t &#273;&#7883;nh, H&agrave;m m&#7909;c ti&ecirc;u, R&agrave;ng bu&#7897;c, Ph&acirc;n t&iacute;ch &#273;&#7897; nh&#7841;y </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; Bi&#7871;n s&#7889;, Ph&#432;&#417;ng tr&igrave;nh, &#272;&#7891; th&#7883;, Thu&#7853;t to&aacute;n, K&#7871;t qu&#7843; </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; Chi ph&iacute;, Doanh thu, L&#7907;i nhu&#7853;n, Ng&acirc;n s&aacute;ch, Nh&acirc;n s&#7921; </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; T&#7853;p h&#7907;p, Ch&#7881; s&#7889;, H&#7857;ng s&#7889;, H&agrave;m s&#7889;, Nghi&#7879;m nguy&ecirc;n </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Correct answer</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Question 2</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">1 / 1 pts</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">L&#7895;i ph&#7893; bi&#7871;n nh&#7845;t khi x&acirc;y d&#7921;ng m&ocirc; h&igrave;nh t&#7889;i &#432;u h&oacute;a &#273;&#432;&#7907;c &#273;&#7873; c&#7853;p trong slide l&agrave; g&igrave;?</span></p><p class="c1 c3"><span class="c0"></span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0 c2">&nbsp; Nh&#7847;m l&#7851;n gi&#7919;a D&#7919; li&#7879;u &#273;&#7847;u v&agrave;o (Bi&#7871;t tr&#432;&#7899;c) v&agrave; Bi&#7871;n quy&#7871;t &#273;&#7883;nh (M&ocirc; h&igrave;nh t&igrave;m ra) </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; S&#7917; d&#7909;ng qu&aacute; nhi&#7873;u bi&#7871;n quy&#7871;t &#273;&#7883;nh s&#7889; nguy&ecirc;n </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; Ch&#7885;n h&agrave;m m&#7909;c ti&ecirc;u l&agrave; phi tuy&#7871;n thay v&igrave; tuy&#7871;n t&iacute;nh </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; Kh&ocirc;ng &#273;&#432;a &#273;i&#7873;u ki&#7879;n r&agrave;ng bu&#7897;c ng&acirc;n s&aacute;ch v&agrave;o m&ocirc; h&igrave;nh </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Correct answer</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Question 3</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">1 / 1 pts</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Trong b&agrave;i to&aacute;n Quy ho&#7841;ch tuy&#7871;n t&iacute;nh (LP) chu&#7849;n, nghi&#7879;m t&#7889;i &#432;u lu&ocirc;n n&#7857;m &#7903; &#273;&acirc;u tr&ecirc;n &#273;&#7891; th&#7883; mi&#7873;n kh&#7843; thi?</span></p><p class="c1 c3"><span class="c0"></span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0 c2">&nbsp; T&#7841;i m&#7897;t &#273;&#7881;nh c&#7911;a mi&#7873;n kh&#7843; thi </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; T&#7841;i tr&#7885;ng t&acirc;m c&#7911;a mi&#7873;n kh&#7843; thi </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; T&#7841;i &#273;i&#7875;m ch&iacute;nh gi&#7919;a c&#7911;a r&agrave;ng bu&#7897;c ch&#7863;t nh&#7845;t </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; N&#7857;m ng&#7851;u nhi&ecirc;n b&ecirc;n trong mi&#7873;n kh&#7843; thi </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Correct answer</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Question 4</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">1 / 1 pts</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Khi th&ecirc;m m&#7897;t &#273;i&#7873;u ki&#7879;n r&agrave;ng bu&#7897;c m&#7899;i v&agrave;o b&agrave;i to&aacute;n t&#7889;i &#432;u h&oacute;a tuy&#7871;n t&iacute;nh, gi&aacute; tr&#7883; h&agrave;m m&#7909;c ti&ecirc;u (nghi&#7879;m t&#7889;i &#432;u) s&#7869; thay &#273;&#7893;i nh&#432; th&#7871; n&agrave;o?</span></p><p class="c1 c3"><span class="c0"></span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0 c2">&nbsp; Ch&#7881; c&oacute; th&#7875; t&#7879; &#273;i ho&#7863;c gi&#7919; nguy&ecirc;n (kh&ocirc;ng bao gi&#7901; t&#7889;t h&#417;n) </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; Lu&ocirc;n lu&ocirc;n t&#7889;t h&#417;n tr&#432;&#7899;c </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; Ch&#7855;c ch&#7855;n kh&ocirc;ng thay &#273;&#7893;i </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; T&#259;ng g&#7845;p &#273;&ocirc;i gi&aacute; tr&#7883; ban &#273;&#7847;u </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Correct answer</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Question 5</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">1 / 1 pts</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Kh&aacute;i ni&#7879;m &#39;Gi&aacute; b&oacute;ng&#39; (Shadow price) c&#7911;a m&#7897;t t&agrave;i nguy&ecirc;n &#273;&#7841;i di&#7879;n cho &#273;i&#7873;u g&igrave;?</span></p><p class="c1 c3"><span class="c0"></span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0 c2">&nbsp; L&#432;&#7907;ng m&#7909;c ti&ecirc;u t&#259;ng th&ecirc;m t&#432;&#417;ng &#7913;ng khi b&#7893; sung th&ecirc;m 1 &#273;&#417;n v&#7883; t&agrave;i nguy&ecirc;n &#273;&oacute; </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; Gi&aacute; tr&#7883; gi&#7843;m b&#7899;t c&#7911;a h&agrave;m m&#7909;c ti&ecirc;u khi b&#7887; b&#7899;t t&agrave;i nguy&ecirc;n </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; Chi ph&iacute; c&#7889; &#273;&#7883;nh &#273;&#7875; mua t&agrave;i nguy&ecirc;n tr&ecirc;n th&#7883; tr&#432;&#7901;ng </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; Chi ph&iacute; c&#417; h&#7897;i khi t&agrave;i nguy&ecirc;n b&#7883; l&atilde;ng ph&iacute; </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Correct answer</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Question 6</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">1 / 1 pts</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Theo nguy&ecirc;n l&yacute; B&ugrave; l&#7887;ng (Complementary slackness), gi&aacute; b&oacute;ng c&#7911;a m&#7897;t t&agrave;i nguy&ecirc;n c&ograve;n d&#432; (ch&#432;a d&ugrave;ng h&#7871;t) b&#7857;ng bao nhi&ecirc;u?</span></p><p class="c1 c3"><span class="c0"></span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0 c2">&nbsp; B&#7857;ng 0 </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; B&#7857;ng 1 </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; B&#7857;ng t&#7893;ng ng&acirc;n s&aacute;ch </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; B&#7857;ng v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Correct answer</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Question 7</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">1 / 1 pts</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">V&igrave; sao b&agrave;i to&aacute;n m&#7841;ng (Network problems) l&#7841;i r&#7845;t &#273;&#432;&#7907;c &#432;a chu&#7897;ng trong th&#7921;c t&#7871;?</span></p><p class="c1 c3"><span class="c0"></span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0 c2">&nbsp; Tr&#7921;c quan d&#7877; v&#7869;, thu&#7853;t to&aacute;n gi&#7843;i si&ecirc;u nhanh v&agrave; t&#7921; &#273;&#7897;ng ra nghi&#7879;m nguy&ecirc;n </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; Kh&ocirc;ng bao gi&#7901; c&#7847;n d&#7919; li&#7879;u &#273;&#7847;u v&agrave;o </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; Lu&ocirc;n cho nghi&#7879;m l&agrave; s&#7889; th&#7921;c c&oacute; d&#7845;u ph&#7849;y &#273;&#7897;ng </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; Ch&#7881; gi&#7843;i &#273;&#432;&#7907;c c&aacute;c b&agrave;i to&aacute;n nh&#7887; d&#432;&#7899;i 5 bi&#7871;n </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Correct answer</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Question 8</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">1 / 1 pts</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Trong b&agrave;i to&aacute;n quy ho&#7841;ch nguy&ecirc;n, ph&#432;&#417;ng ph&aacute;p &#273;&#417;n gi&#7843;n l&agrave; &#39;l&agrave;m tr&ograve;n&#39; nghi&#7879;m s&#7889; th&#7921;c t&#7915; LP c&oacute; nguy c&#417; g&acirc;y ra h&#7853;u qu&#7843; g&igrave;?</span></p><p class="c1 c3"><span class="c0"></span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0 c2">&nbsp; C&oacute; th&#7875; l&agrave;m vi ph&#7841;m c&aacute;c &#273;i&#7873;u ki&#7879;n r&agrave;ng bu&#7897;c (nghi&#7879;m kh&ocirc;ng kh&#7843; thi) ho&#7863;c v&#432;&#7907;t ng&acirc;n s&aacute;ch </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; L&agrave;m cho m&ocirc; h&igrave;nh ch&#7841;y ch&#7853;m h&#417;n 100 l&#7847;n </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; Lu&ocirc;n lu&ocirc;n thu &#273;&#432;&#7907;c nghi&#7879;m t&#7889;i &#432;u ch&iacute;nh x&aacute;c </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; T&#7921; &#273;&#7897;ng chuy&#7875;n b&agrave;i to&aacute;n tuy&#7871;n t&iacute;nh th&agrave;nh phi tuy&#7871;n </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Correct answer</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Question 9</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">1 / 1 pts</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Thu&#7853;t to&aacute;n ch&iacute;nh x&aacute;c ph&#7893; bi&#7871;n nh&#7845;t &#273;&#432;&#7907;c d&ugrave;ng &#273;&#7875; gi&#7843;i b&agrave;i to&aacute;n quy ho&#7841;ch nguy&ecirc;n (IP) b&#7857;ng c&aacute;ch chia nh&#7887; b&agrave;i to&aacute;n v&agrave; lo&#7841;i b&#7887; nh&aacute;nh v&ocirc; &iacute;ch l&agrave;:</span></p><p class="c1 c3"><span class="c0"></span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0 c2">&nbsp; Thu&#7853;t to&aacute;n Nh&aacute;nh v&agrave; C&#7853;n (Branch and Bound) </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; Thu&#7853;t to&aacute;n Di truy&#7873;n (Genetic Algorithm) </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; Ph&#432;&#417;ng ph&aacute;p 2-opt </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; Thu&#7853;t to&aacute;n L&aacute;ng gi&#7873;ng g&#7847;n nh&#7845;t (Nearest Neighbor) </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Correct answer</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Question 10</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">1 / 1 pts</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Trong b&agrave;i to&aacute;n t&#7889;i &#432;u nhi&#7873;u m&#7909;c ti&ecirc;u, m&#7897;t l&#7921;a ch&#7885;n A &#273;&#432;&#7907;c g&#7885;i l&agrave; &#39;Tr&#7897;i&#39; (Dominate) l&#7921;a ch&#7885;n B khi n&agrave;o</span></p><p class="c1 c3"><span class="c0"></span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0 c2">&nbsp; A kh&ocirc;ng t&#7879; h&#417;n B &#7903; m&#7885;i m&#7909;c ti&ecirc;u V&Agrave; t&#7889;t h&#417;n h&#7859;n &#7903; &iacute;t nh&#7845;t m&#7897;t m&#7909;c ti&ecirc;u </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; A t&#7889;t h&#417;n B &#7903; t&#7845;t c&#7843; c&aacute;c m&#7909;c ti&ecirc;u </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; A c&oacute; chi ph&iacute; th&#7845;p h&#417;n B b&#7845;t ch&#7845;p c&aacute;c y&#7871;u t&#7889; kh&aacute;c </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; A v&agrave; B c&oacute; gi&aacute; tr&#7883; h&agrave;m m&#7909;c ti&ecirc;u b&#7857;ng nhau</span></p><p class="c1 c3"><span class="c0"></span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c4">Tu&#7847;n 5:</span></p><p class="c1 c3"><span class="c4"></span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Question 1</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">1 / 1 pts</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">M&#7897;t c&ocirc;ng ty logistics d&ugrave;ng m&ocirc; h&igrave;nh gi&#7843;i t&iacute;ch &#273;&#7875; ch&#7885;n s&#7889; kho. T&#7841;i s&#7889; kho t&#7889;i &#432;u N*, t&#7893;ng chi ph&iacute; x&acirc;y d&#7921;ng kho l&agrave; 50 t&#7927; &#273;&#7891;ng/n&#259;m. Theo m&ocirc; h&igrave;nh, t&#7893;ng chi ph&iacute; (x&acirc;y d&#7921;ng + v&#7853;n chuy&#7875;n) t&#7841;i N* x&#7845;p x&#7881; bao nhi&ecirc;u?</span></p><p class="c1 c3"><span class="c0"></span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0 c2">&nbsp; 150 t&#7927; </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; 100 t&#7927; </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; 75 t&#7927; </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; 200 t&#7927; </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Correct answer</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Question 2</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">1 / 1 pts</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">S&#7889; tr&#7841;m t&#7889;i &#432;u theo m&ocirc; h&igrave;nh gi&#7843;i t&iacute;ch l&agrave; 15, nh&#432;ng th&agrave;nh ph&#7889; ch&#7881; &#273;&#7911; &#273;&#7845;t cho 12 tr&#7841;m (80% t&#7889;i &#432;u). Nh&#7853;n &#273;&#7883;nh n&agrave;o h&#7907;p l&yacute; nh&#7845;t?</span></p><p class="c1 c3"><span class="c0"></span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0 c2">&nbsp; Chi ph&iacute; ch&#7881; t&#259;ng kh&ocirc;ng qu&aacute; kho&#7843;ng 10%, v&igrave; t&#7893;ng chi ph&iacute; r&#7845;t ph&#7859;ng quanh &#273;i&#7875;m t&#7889;i &#432;u </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; Chi ph&iacute; s&#7869; t&#259;ng kho&#7843;ng 20%, t&#432;&#417;ng &#7913;ng v&#7899;i 20% thi&#7871;u h&#7909;t tr&#7841;m </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; Ph&#432;&#417;ng &aacute;n kh&ocirc;ng kh&#7843; thi, b&#7855;t bu&#7897;c ph&#7843;i t&igrave;m th&ecirc;m &#273;&#7845;t </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; Chi ph&iacute; s&#7869; gi&#7843;m v&igrave; &iacute;t tr&#7841;m h&#417;n </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Correct answer</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Question 3</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">1 / 1 pts</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">M&#7897;t chu&#7895;i b&aacute;n l&#7867; t&iacute;nh s&#7889; c&#7917;a h&agrave;ng cho c&#7843; Vi&#7879;t Nam b&#7857;ng c&aacute;ch gi&#7843; &#273;&#7883;nh nhu c&#7847;u tr&#7843;i &#273;&#7873;u tr&ecirc;n to&agrave;n qu&#7889;c, thay v&igrave; t&iacute;nh ri&ecirc;ng t&#7915;ng v&ugrave;ng. R&#7911;i ro ch&iacute;nh l&agrave; g&igrave;?</span></p><p class="c1 c3"><span class="c0"></span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0 c2">&nbsp; Th&#7915;a c&#417; s&#7903; &#7903; nh&#7919;ng v&ugrave;ng th&#432;a d&acirc;n v&agrave; &#432;&#7899;c t&iacute;nh chi ph&iacute; sai l&#7879;ch </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; Thi&#7871;u c&#7917;a h&agrave;ng &#7903; m&#7885;i v&ugrave;ng </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; Kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; r&#7911;i ro v&igrave; m&ocirc; h&igrave;nh gi&#7843;i t&iacute;ch lu&ocirc;n ch&iacute;nh x&aacute;c </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; Ch&#7881; sai &#7903; c&aacute;c th&agrave;nh ph&#7889; l&#7899;n, v&ugrave;ng th&#432;a d&acirc;n lu&ocirc;n &#273;&uacute;ng </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Correct answer</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Question 4</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">1 / 1 pts</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">D&ugrave;ng thu&#7853;t to&aacute;n Weiszfeld &#273;&#7875; t&igrave;m v&#7883; tr&iacute; kho cho c&aacute;c c&#7917;a h&agrave;ng &#7903; H&agrave; N&#7897;i, k&#7871;t qu&#7843; r&#417;i v&agrave;o gi&#7919;a H&#7891; T&acirc;y. C&aacute;ch x&#7917; l&yacute; ph&ugrave; h&#7907;p nh&#7845;t l&agrave; g&igrave;?</span></p><p class="c1 c3"><span class="c0"></span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0 c2">&nbsp; Chuy&#7875;n sang m&ocirc; h&igrave;nh r&#7901;i r&#7841;c v&#7899;i danh s&aacute;ch c&aacute;c v&#7883; tr&iacute; &#7913;ng vi&ecirc;n kh&#7843; thi </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; Ch&#7841;y th&ecirc;m v&agrave;i ch&#7909;c v&ograve;ng l&#7863;p &#273;&#7875; thu&#7853;t to&aacute;n t&#7921; d&#7901;i &#273;i&#7875;m ra b&#7901; </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; T&#259;ng tr&#7885;ng s&#7889; c&#7911;a c&#7917;a h&agrave;ng g&#7847;n nh&#7845;t </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; Ch&#7845;p nh&#7853;n k&#7871;t qu&#7843; v&igrave; &#273;&oacute; l&agrave; &#273;i&#7875;m t&#7889;i &#432;u to&aacute;n h&#7885;c </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Correct answer</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Question 5</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">1 / 1 pts</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">N&#259;m l&agrave;ng n&#7857;m tr&ecirc;n m&#7897;t con &#273;&#432;&#7901;ng th&#7859;ng theo th&#7913; t&#7921; P&ndash;Q&ndash;R&ndash;S&ndash;T v&#7899;i nhu c&#7847;u l&#7847;n l&#432;&#7907;t 10, 15, 5, 30, 40 (t&#7893;ng 100). &Aacute;p d&#7909;ng thu&#7853;t to&aacute;n &ldquo;g&#7845;p l&aacute;&rdquo; c&#7911;a Goldman, n&ecirc;n &#273;&#7863;t 1 tr&#7841;m y t&#7871; &#7903; &#273;&acirc;u?</span></p><p class="c1 c3"><span class="c0"></span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0 c2">&nbsp; S </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; T (nhu c&#7847;u l&#7899;n nh&#7845;t) </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; R (n&#7857;m ch&iacute;nh gi&#7919;a) </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; Q </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Correct answer</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Question 6</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">1 / 1 pts</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Tr&ecirc;n m&#7841;ng 7 khu A&ndash;G c&#7911;a b&agrave;i gi&#7843;ng, v&#7899;i ng&#432;&#7905;ng 8 ph&uacute;t, c&#7863;p tr&#7841;m n&agrave;o sau &#273;&acirc;y KH&Ocirc;NG ph&#7911; &#273;&#432;&#7907;c t&#7845;t c&#7843; c&aacute;c khu?</span></p><p class="c1 c3"><span class="c0"></span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0 c2">&nbsp; {C, G} </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; {D, E} </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; C, E} </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; {A, E} </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Correct answer</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Question 7</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">1 / 1 pts</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">V&#7851;n m&#7841;ng 7 khu (t&#7893;ng 870 cu&#7897;c g&#7885;i/n&#259;m), ng&#432;&#7905;ng ph&#7911; 5 ph&uacute;t. N&#7871;u ch&#7881; &#273;&#7863;t 1 tr&#7841;m t&#7841;i C, tr&#7841;m n&agrave;y ph&#7911; &#273;&#432;&#7907;c bao nhi&ecirc;u cu&#7897;c g&#7885;i?</span></p><p class="c1 c3"><span class="c0"></span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0 c2">&nbsp; 300 </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; 120 </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; 345 </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; 450 </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Correct answer</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Question 8</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">1 / 1 pts</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Gi&#7843;i b&agrave;i to&aacute;n p-t&acirc;m b&#7857;ng t&igrave;m ki&#7871;m nh&#7883; ph&acirc;n v&#7899;i m&ocirc; h&igrave;nh ph&#7911; t&#7889;i &#273;a. Kho&#7843;ng hi&#7879;n t&#7841;i l&agrave; [Th&#7845;p = 5, Cao = 8]. Th&#7917; ng&#432;&#7905;ng 6 ph&uacute;t th&igrave; ph&#7911; &#273;&#432;&#7907;c h&#7871;t. B&#432;&#7899;c ti&#7871;p theo l&agrave; g&igrave;?</span></p><p class="c1 c3"><span class="c0"></span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0 c2">&nbsp; Kho&#7843;ng m&#7899;i [5, 6] </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; Kho&#7843;ng m&#7899;i [6, 8] </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; D&#7915;ng, &#273;&aacute;p &aacute;n l&agrave; 6 </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; Kho&#7843;ng m&#7899;i [0, 6] </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Correct answer</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Question 9</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">1 / 1 pts</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Hai th&ocirc;n c&oacute; d&acirc;n s&#7889; b&#7857;ng nhau, c&aacute;ch nhau 10 km tr&ecirc;n m&#7897;t con &#273;&#432;&#7901;ng. C&#7847;n &#273;&#7863;t 1 tr&#7841;m c&#7913;u h&#7897; &#273;&#7875; kho&#7843;ng c&aacute;ch xa nh&#7845;t l&agrave; nh&#7887; nh&#7845;t, v&agrave; &#273;&#432;&#7907;c ph&eacute;p &#273;&#7863;t &#7903; b&#7845;t k&#7923; &#273;i&#7875;m n&agrave;o tr&ecirc;n &#273;&#432;&#7901;ng. Kho&#7843;ng c&aacute;ch xa nh&#7845;t t&#7889;i &#432;u l&agrave; bao nhi&ecirc;u?</span></p><p class="c1 c3"><span class="c0"></span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0 c2">&nbsp; 5 km </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; 10 km </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; 0 km </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; 7,5 km </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Correct answer</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Question 10</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">1 / 1 pts</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">M&#7897;t qu&#7853;n &#273;ang c&oacute; 1 tr&#7841;m c&#7913;u th&#432;&#417;ng &#7903; v&#7883; tr&iacute; t&#7889;i &#432;u theo p-trung v&#7883;. Nay c&oacute; ng&acirc;n s&aacute;ch cho tr&#7841;m th&#7913; hai, tr&#432;&#7903;ng ph&ograve;ng &#273;&#7873; xu&#7845;t gi&#7919; nguy&ecirc;n tr&#7841;m c&#361; v&agrave; ch&#7881; ch&#7885;n th&ecirc;m 1 v&#7883; tr&iacute; t&#7889;t nh&#7845;t. Nh&#7853;n &#273;&#7883;nh n&agrave;o &#273;&uacute;ng?</span></p><p class="c1 c3"><span class="c0"></span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0 c2">&nbsp; C&oacute; th&#7875; k&eacute;m t&#7889;i &#432;u &#273;&aacute;ng k&#7875;, v&igrave; c&#7863;p tr&#7841;m t&#7889;i &#432;u c&oacute; th&#7875; kh&ocirc;ng ch&#7913;a tr&#7841;m c&#361; </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; Lu&ocirc;n cho nghi&#7879;m t&#7889;i &#432;u v&igrave; tr&#7841;m c&#361; &#273;&atilde; t&#7889;i &#432;u </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; Ch&#7881; k&eacute;m t&#7889;i &#432;u khi d&ugrave;ng m&ocirc; h&igrave;nh ph&#7911;, kh&ocirc;ng x&#7843;y ra v&#7899;i p-trung v&#7883; </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; Lu&ocirc;n k&eacute;m &#273;&uacute;ng 26% </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Correct answer</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Question 11</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">1 / 1 pts</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Trong b&agrave;i to&aacute;n ph&iacute; c&#7889; &#273;&#7883;nh, gi&aacute; x&#259;ng t&#259;ng m&#7841;nh khi&#7871;n chi ph&iacute; v&#7853;n chuy&#7875;n m&#7895;i cu&#7897;c g&#7885;i tr&ecirc;n m&#7895;i ph&uacute;t (&alpha;) t&#259;ng. M&ocirc; h&igrave;nh s&#7869; c&oacute; xu h&#432;&#7899;ng &#273;&#7873; xu&#7845;t g&igrave;?</span></p><p class="c1 c3"><span class="c0"></span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0 c2">&nbsp; M&#7903; nhi&#7873;u tr&#7841;m h&#417;n, k&#7875; c&#7843; tr&#7841;m c&oacute; chi ph&iacute; m&#7903; cao </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; &#272;&oacute;ng b&#7899;t tr&#7841;m &#273;&#7875; ti&#7871;t ki&#7879;m </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; Gi&#7919; nguy&ecirc;n s&#7889; tr&#7841;m </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; Ch&#7881; m&#7903; tr&#7841;m r&#7867; nh&#7845;t l&agrave; G </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Correct answer</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Question 12</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">1 / 1 pts</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">H&#7897;i &#273;&#7891;ng th&agrave;nh ph&#7889; &#273;&#432;&#7907;c &#273;&aacute;nh gi&aacute; theo ti&ecirc;u ch&iacute; &ldquo;% cu&#7897;c g&#7885;i &#273;&#432;&#7907;c ph&#7909;c v&#7909; trong 5 ph&uacute;t&rdquo;. V&#7899;i 3 tr&#7841;m tr&ecirc;n m&#7841;ng A&ndash;G, h&#7885; n&ecirc;n ch&#7885;n ph&#432;&#417;ng &aacute;n n&agrave;o?</span></p><p class="c1 c3"><span class="c0"></span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0 c2">&nbsp; B, C, G (ph&#7911; 825/870 trong 5 ph&uacute;t) </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; B, C, E (trung b&igrave;nh 1,615 ph&uacute;t) </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; A, D, F </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; ai ph&#432;&#417;ng &aacute;n nh&#432; nhau v&igrave; c&ugrave;ng 3 tr&#7841;m </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Correct answer</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Question 13</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">1 / 1 pts</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">M&#7897;t qu&#7853;n &#273;&ocirc;ng d&acirc;n th&#432;&#7901;ng xuy&ecirc;n g&#7863;p t&igrave;nh tr&#7841;ng &ldquo;t&#7845;t c&#7843; xe c&#7845;p c&#7913;u &#273;&#7873;u b&#7853;n&rdquo;. M&ocirc; h&igrave;nh n&agrave;o ph&ugrave; h&#7907;p nh&#7845;t &#273;&#7875; b&#7889; tr&iacute; xe?</span></p><p class="c1 c3"><span class="c0"></span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0 c2">&nbsp; Ph&#7911; d&#7921; ph&ograve;ng ho&#7863;c ph&#7911; k&#7923; v&#7885;ng (t&iacute;nh x&aacute;c su&#7845;t xe b&#7853;n) </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; Ph&#7911; t&#7853;p h&#7907;p c&#417; b&#7843;n </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; p-ph&acirc;n t&aacute;n </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; M&ocirc; h&igrave;nh Weber </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Correct answer</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Question 14</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">1 / 1 pts</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">B&#7889;n ph&#432;&#7901;ng n&#7857;m li&#7873;n nhau theo h&agrave;ng P&ndash;Q&ndash;R&ndash;S v&#7899;i s&#7889; h&#7885;c sinh 8, 10, 7, 5 (ngh&igrave;n). C&#7847;n chia th&agrave;nh 2 khu tuy&#7875;n sinh li&#7873;n k&#7873;. &#272;&#7897; l&#7879;ch nh&#7887; nh&#7845;t gi&#7919;a hai khu l&agrave; bao nhi&ecirc;u?</span></p><p class="c1 c3"><span class="c0"></span></p><p class="c1"><span>&nbsp; </span><span class="c0 c2">6 </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; 0 </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; 14 </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; 20 </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Correct answer</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Question 15</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">1 / 1 pts</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&#272;&#7889;i th&#7911; &#273;&atilde; m&#7903; c&#7917;a h&agrave;ng t&#7841;i B tr&ecirc;n m&#7841;ng A&ndash;G (kh&aacute;ch &#273;i v&#7873; c&#7917;a h&agrave;ng g&#7847;n nh&#7845;t, b&#7857;ng nhau th&igrave; chia &#273;&ocirc;i). B&#7841;n ch&#7881; m&#7903; 1 c&#7917;a h&agrave;ng. &#272;&#7863;t t&#7841;i E th&igrave; thu &#273;&#432;&#7907;c 365 kh&aacute;ch; &#273;&#7863;t ngay t&#7841;i B th&igrave; sao?</span></p><p class="c1 c3"><span class="c0"></span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0 c2">&nbsp; 435 kh&aacute;ch &mdash; t&#7889;t h&#417;n E </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; 200 kh&aacute;ch </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; 870 kh&aacute;ch </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; 0 kh&aacute;ch v&igrave; &#273;&#7889;i th&#7911; &#273;&atilde; chi&#7871;m B </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Quiz Score: 15 out of 15</span></p><p class="c1 c3"><span class="c0"></span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c4">Tu&#7847;n 6:</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Question 1</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">1 / 1 pts</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">M&#7897;t qu&aacute;n c&agrave; ph&ecirc; c&oacute; trung b&igrave;nh 40 kh&aacute;ch &#273;&#7871;n m&#7895;i gi&#7901;, m&#7895;i kh&aacute;ch &#7903; l&#7841;i trong qu&aacute;n trung b&igrave;nh 12 ph&uacute;t. Theo &#273;&#7883;nh lu&#7853;t Little, s&#7889; kh&aacute;ch trung b&igrave;nh c&oacute; m&#7863;t trong qu&aacute;n l&agrave; bao nhi&ecirc;u?</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; 3,33 kh&aacute;ch </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; 4,8 kh&aacute;ch </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; 480 kh&aacute;ch </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0 c2">&nbsp; 8 kh&aacute;ch </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Correct answer</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Question 2</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">1 / 1 pts</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">T&#7841;i m&#7897;t chi nh&aacute;nh ng&acirc;n h&agrave;ng, kh&aacute;ch &#273;&#7871;n v&#7899;i t&#7889;c &#273;&#7897; &lambda; = 24 kh&aacute;ch/gi&#7901; v&agrave; trung b&igrave;nh lu&ocirc;n c&oacute; Lq = 6 kh&aacute;ch &#273;ang &#273;&#7913;ng ch&#7901;. Th&#7901;i gian ch&#7901; trung b&igrave;nh Wq c&#7911;a m&#7895;i kh&aacute;ch l&agrave;:</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0 c2">&nbsp; 15 ph&uacute;t </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; 0,25 ph&uacute;t </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; 4 ph&uacute;t </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; 144 ph&uacute;t </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Correct answer</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Question 3</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">1 / 1 pts</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">M&#7897;t qu&#7847;y d&#7883;ch v&#7909; c&oacute; &lambda; = 12 kh&aacute;ch/gi&#7901;, th&#7901;i gian ch&#7901; trung b&igrave;nh Wq = 6 ph&uacute;t, th&#7901;i gian ph&#7909;c v&#7909; trung b&igrave;nh 1/&mu; = 4 ph&uacute;t. S&#7889; kh&aacute;ch trung b&igrave;nh trong to&agrave;n h&#7879; th&#7889;ng L l&agrave;:</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; 0,8 kh&aacute;ch </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0 c2">&nbsp; 2 kh&aacute;ch </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; 120 kh&aacute;ch </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; 1,2 kh&aacute;ch </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Correct answer</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Question 4</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">1 / 1 pts</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">M&#7897;t nh&agrave; thu&#7889;c c&oacute; 1 d&#432;&#7907;c s&#297; (m&ocirc; h&igrave;nh M/M/1), kh&aacute;ch &#273;&#7871;n 18 ng&#432;&#7901;i/gi&#7901;, th&#7901;i gian ph&#7909;c v&#7909; trung b&igrave;nh 3 ph&uacute;t/kh&aacute;ch. X&aacute;c su&#7845;t m&#7897;t kh&aacute;ch v&#7915;a