= 0,75, th&#7901;i gian ph&#7909;c v&#7909; trung b&igrave;nh 4 ph&uacute;t, h&#7879; s&#7889; bi&#7871;n thi&ecirc;n b&igrave;nh ph&#432;&#417;ng c&#7911;a th&#7901;i gian gi&#7919;a hai l&#7847;n &#273;&#7871;n c&#8336;&sup2; = 1 v&agrave; c&#7911;a th&#7901;i gian ph&#7909;c v&#7909; c&#8347;&sup2; = 0,25. Theo c&ocirc;ng th&#7913;c x&#7845;p x&#7881;, Wq &asymp; ?</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; 15 ph&uacute;t </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; 3 ph&uacute;t </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0 c2">&nbsp; 7,5 ph&uacute;t </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; 12 ph&uacute;t </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Correct answer</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Question 8</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">1 / 1 pts</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Trong m&ocirc; h&igrave;nh M/M/1, n&#7871;u h&#7879; s&#7889; s&#7917; d&#7909;ng t&#259;ng t&#7915; &rho; = 0,8 l&ecirc;n &rho; = 0,95 th&igrave; s&#7889; kh&aacute;ch trung b&igrave;nh trong h&#7879; th&#7889;ng L t&#259;ng l&ecirc;n kho&#7843;ng bao nhi&ecirc;u l&#7847;n?</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; 1,19 l&#7847;n </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; 15 l&#7847;n </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; 2 l&#7847;n </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0 c2">&nbsp; 4,75 l&#7847;n </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Correct answer</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Question 9</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">1 / 1 pts</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">M&#7897;t tr&#7841;m thu ph&iacute; 1 l&agrave;n (M/M/1) c&oacute; &lambda; = 50 xe/gi&#7901;, &mu; = 60 xe/gi&#7901;. Th&#7901;i gian m&#7897;t xe &#7903; trong h&#7879; th&#7889;ng tu&acirc;n theo ph&acirc;n ph&#7889;i m&#361; v&#7899;i trung b&igrave;nh W = 1/(&mu; &minus; &lambda;). X&aacute;c su&#7845;t m&#7897;t xe ph&#7843;i &#7903; l&