"c0">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Correct answer</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Question 12</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">1 / 1 pts</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">M&#7897;t b&atilde;i &#273;&#7895; xe c&oacute; xe &#273;&#7871;n theo qu&aacute; tr&igrave;nh Poisson v&#7899;i 600 xe/gi&#7901;, m&#7895;i xe &#7903; &#273;&uacute;ng 2 gi&#7901;. S&#7889; xe trong b&atilde;i ~ Poisson(1.200) &asymp; Chu&#7849;n(1.200; &radic;1.200 &asymp; 34,6). &#272;&#7875; b&atilde;i KH&Ocirc;NG &#273;&#7847;y v&#7899;i x&aacute;c su&#7845;t 98% (z &asymp; 2,054), c&#7847;n kho&#7843;ng bao nhi&ecirc;u ch&#7895;?</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; 1.340 ch&#7895; </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0 c2">&nbsp; 1.271 ch&#7895; </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; 1.235 ch&#7895; </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; 1.200 ch&#7895; </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Correct answer</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Question 13</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">1 / 1 pts</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">M&#7897;t b&atilde;i &#273;&#7895; nh&#7887; c&oacute; 3 ch&#7895;, kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; ch&#7895; ch&#7901; (xe &#273;&#7871;n khi &#273;&#7847;y th&igrave; b&#7887; &#273;i). Xe &#273;&#7871;n 2 xe/gi&#7901;, m&#7895;i xe &#273;&#7895; trung b&igrave;nh 1 gi&#7901;. Theo c&ocirc;ng th&#7913;c Erlang B, t&#7881; l&#7879; xe b&#7883; t&#7915; ch&#7889;i l&agrave; kho&#7843;ng:</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; 66,7% </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; 33,3% </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0 c2">&nbsp; 21,1% </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; 13,3% </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Correct answer</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Question 14</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">1 / 1 pts</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">M&#7897;t m&aacute;y r&#7917;a xe t&#7921; &#273;&#7897;ng c&oacute; th&#7901;i gian r&#7917;a c&#7889; &#273;&#7883;nh 4 ph&uacute;t/xe (M/D/1), xe &#273;&#7871;n 12 xe/gi&#7901;. Th&#7901;i gian ch&#7901; trung b&igrave;nh Wq theo c&ocirc;ng th&#7913;c Pollaczek&ndash;Khinchine (&sigma; = 0) l&agrave;:</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; 16 ph&uacute;t </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; 4 ph&uacute;t </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; 24 ph&uacute;t </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0 c2">&nbsp; 8 ph&uacute;t </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Correct answer</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Question 15</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">1 / 1 pts</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">M&#7897;t ph&ograve;ng kh&aacute;m c&oacute; 1 l&#7877; t&acirc;n v&agrave; 3 &#273;&#432;&#7901;ng d&acirc;y &#273;i&#7879;n tho&#7841;i (M/M/1 gi&#7899;i h&#7841;n M = 3). C&oacute; 6 cu&#7897;c g&#7885;i/gi&#7901;, m&#7895;i cu&#7897;c k&eacute;o d&agrave;i trung b&igrave;nh 5 ph&uacute;t. M&#7895;i gi&#7901; trung b&igrave;nh c&oacute; bao nhi&ecirc;u cu&#7897;c g&#7885;i g&#7863;p t&iacute;n hi&#7879;u b&#7853;n?</span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; 0,067 cu&#7897;c </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; 3 cu&#7897;c </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0 c2">&nbsp; 0,4 cu&#7897;c </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">&nbsp; 0,75 cu&#7897;c </span></p><p class="c1"><span class="c0">Quiz Score: 15 out of 15</span></p><p class="c1 c3"><span class="c0"></span></p></body></html>